src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol:_redeemShares:100|class=C21|High|An unprivileged account initiates a withdraw (freezing w.sharesAmount/w.yieldTokenAmount), then increases its own share balance in the same vault by depositing again or receiving shares, and redeems the full balance on the escrow branch so that w.yieldTokenAmount * sharesToRedeem / w.sharesAmount releases more escrowed sUSDe/USDe from the manager's shared per-vault cooldown position than it ever escrowed, at the expense of every other account with a pending request.|src/staking/AbstractStakingStrategy.sol
